l14: $ G , z ∊ A × B , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ A , v ∊ B , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = cpr u v ⇒ w = cpr u v $ by ax
l15: $ … ⇒ cpr u v = w $ by eq_sym [l14]
l16: $ G , z ∊ A × B , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ A , v ∊ B , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = cpr u v ⇒ u ∊ A ∪ B $ by weaken [l4]
l17: $ G , z ∊ A × B , z = ⟨ u , v ⟩ , u ∊ A , v ∊ B , w ∊ ⟨ u , v ⟩ , w = cpr u v ⇒ v ∊ A ∪ B $ by weaken [l5]
