l3: $ z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R ⇒ z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R $ by ax
