l12: $ … ⇒ a = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ S $ by and_intro [l3, l11]
l13: $ … ⇒ ∃ y (a = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ S) $ by ex_intro [l12]
l14: $ … ⇒ ∃ x ∃ y (a = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ S) $ by ex_intro [l13]
l15: $ … ⇒ a ∊ {z | ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ B ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ S)} $ by cab_intro [l14]
l16: $ G , ∃ y (a = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) ⇒ ∃ y (a = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ A ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R) $ by ax
l17: $ … ⇒ a ∊ cres S B $ by ex_elim [l16, l15]
l18: $ … ⇒ a ∊ cres S B $ by ex_elim [l1, l17]

