l9: $ G , z ∊ cres S B ⇒ B = A $ by weaken [l6]
l10: $ … ⇒ z ∊ cres R A $ by welc_cres_eq [l8, l9, l7]
l11: $ … ⇒ cres R A = cres S B $ by eq_intro [l4, l10]

cres_empty
----------
l1: $ G , o ∊ cres R ∅ ⇒ o ∊ {z | ∃ x ∃ y (z = ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∧ x ∊ ∅ ∧ ⟨ x , y ⟩ ∈ R)} $ by ax
